          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "**See and skip what plays next, from the Lock Screen** — the title, artist and cover of the coming track, under the now-playing controls. Tap the cover to play it now.\n\nA port of NextUp 3 by Yves, under the GNU GPL v3. Its own package: this has nothing to do with the social apps the combined Albrhi package patches.",
